=== vec2 from angle (1)
' 0 rad == Vec2(1, 0); Pi/2 ~= Vec2(0, 1) (up to floating-point).
IMPORT "vec2"
PRINT VEC2_FROM_ANGLE(0.0, 1.0)
--- erwartet
Vec2(1.0, 0.0)

